{% comment %}
  Standalone Section Rendering API data endpoint for the `finder-quiz` and `recommendation-quiz`
  sections (`<product-quiz>`). Never placed.

  Fetched via `sectionRenderer.getSectionHTML('section-rendering-product-quiz', false, url)`:
    - Store-filter mode: `url` is the quiz collection URL + the cumulative `filter.*` params, so
      `collection` resolves to that collection with the shopper's answers applied — Shopify
      recomputes every filter's value counts against the active selection (mirror:
      section-rendering-product-finder.liquid).
    - Product-list mode (and the fallback products): `url` is
      `/search?type=product&q=id:1 OR id:2 …`, so `search.results` holds exactly those products.

  Emits, all inside `<div hidden>`:
    1. `[data-quiz-filter]` per collection filter, with a `[data-value]` span per value whose
       count is above 0 (collection context only). Every filter is listed, the availability one
       (`filter.v.availability`) included: the runtime detects it there and then adds
       `filter.v.availability=1` to its cascade and results URLs;
    2. `[data-quiz-products]` — the first 12 AVAILABLE products (sold-out ones are skipped in
       both modes) as `snippets/product-quiz-row.liquid`. The runtime trims to the section's
       `results_limit` and, in product-list mode, re-orders to its own id order (search order is
       relevance, not ours). Liquid cannot read an arbitrary query param, so the cap is fixed here.
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign max_rows = 12
  assign rendered = 0
-%}
<div hidden>
  {%- if collection -%}
    <div data-quiz-filters>
      {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
        <div data-quiz-filter data-param-name="{{ filter.param_name }}" data-label="{{ filter.label | escape }}">
          {%- for value in filter.values -%}
            {%- if value.count > 0 -%}
              <span
                data-value="{{ value.value | escape }}"
                data-label="{{ value.label | escape }}"
                data-count="{{ value.count }}"
              ></span>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    <div data-quiz-products>
      {%- paginate collection.products by 24 -%}
        {%- for product in collection.products -%}
          {%- if product.available -%}
            {% render 'product-quiz-row', product: product %}
            {%- assign rendered = rendered | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- if rendered >= max_rows -%}
              {%- break -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endpaginate -%}
    </div>
  {%- elsif search.performed -%}
    <div data-quiz-products>
      {%- paginate search.results by 24 -%}
        {%- for item in search.results -%}
          {%- if item.object_type == 'product' and item.available -%}
            {% render 'product-quiz-row', product: item %}
            {%- assign rendered = rendered | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- if rendered >= max_rows -%}
              {%- break -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endpaginate -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:names.product_quiz_rendering",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header", "footer"]
  },
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
